  <!-- COLD_EXCISION is a model internal method, not one of the fifteen the
       source lists. RF-7.4 reclassifies a cold biopsy that the report says
       was removed into an excision. That reclassified event must take part
       in the RF-5 method and site counting like any other therapeutic
       method, so it needs a method instance to be counted as. Without it a
       cold biopsy removal case counts zero methods and falls through to the
       RF-5.9 hard stop, making WE-19 unreachable. -->
  <concinst name="COLD_EXCISION" type="TherapeuticMethod"/>

